1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,020
Listen to an announcement on a university radio station.

2
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:08,491
Man: Attention, students. Due to construction,

3
00:00:08,491 --> 00:00:16,010
we've had to temporarily reduce the number of available parking spaces on campus.

4
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:25,020
Because of this, the off campus shuttle will now begin running at 6:00 AM rather than 8:00 AM.

5
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:29,768
If you are driving, please pay close attention to the postage signage

6
00:00:29,768 --> 00:00:34,120
and make sure that you are parking in your designated area.

7
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:41,130
Student cars parked in faculty lots at any time will be ticketed or towed.

8
00:00:41,130 --> 00:00:47,130
Please visit the Parking Services website if you need to pay a ticket.
